      "message": "I think `AndroidTest.xml` only applies to suite-based tests. \n\nThe doc of `AndroidTest.xml` is under the section `Test through suites` https://source.android.com/docs/core/tests/tradefed/testing/through-suite/android-test-structure\n\nSo far I haven\u0027t met issues without `AndroidTest.xml`:\n- I was able to access hidden API.\n- When I ran `ThreadNetworkIntegrationTests` no undesired test case is included.\n\n```\nRunning Tests...\n\nx86_64 ThreadNetworkIntegrationTests\n------------------------------------\ncom.android.thread.tests.integration (1 Test)\n[1/1] android.net.thread.BorderRoutingTest#infraDevicePingTheadDeviceOmr_Succeeds: PASSED (25.364s)\n```",
